<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>For Shahsta ❤️</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9a9e 0%, #fecfef 99%, #feada6 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            position: relative;
            color: #4a4a4a;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .bg-hearts {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .heart-particle {
            position: absolute;
            color: rgba(255, 105, 180, 0.6);
            animation: float 6s ease-in infinite;
            bottom: -50px;
        }

        @keyframes float {
            0% {
                transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg) scale(0.8);
                opacity: 1;
            }
            100% {
                transform: translateY(-100vh) rotate(360deg) scale(1.2);
                opacity: 0;
            }
        }

        .card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 40px 25px;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 520px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(220, 90, 130, 0.25);
            z-index: 10;
            position: relative;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
            animation: fadeIn 1.2s ease-out;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        h1 {
            color: #d63384;
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', 'Georgia', serif;
        }

        p.subtitle {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            color: #777;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .envelope-btn {
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, #ff4b2b, #ff416c);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 16px 36px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(255, 65, 108, 0.4);
            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
            outline: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .envelope-btn:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(255, 65, 108, 0.6);
        }

        .hidden-message {
            display: none;
            margin-top: 15px;
            text-align: left;
            line-height: 1.7;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            color: #333;
            border-top: 1px dashed #ff9a9e;
            padding-top: 25px;
            animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease-in-out;
        }

        .arabic-text {
            direction: rtl;
            text-align: right;
            font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;
            color: #d63384;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            line-height: 1.9;
            background: #fff0f5;
            padding: 18px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            border-right: 5px solid #d63384;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(214, 51, 132, 0.08);
        }

        .signature {
            margin-top: 25px;
            text-align: right;
            font-style: italic;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #d63384;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="bg-hearts" id="hearts-container"></div>

    <div class="card">
        <h1>For shahyyy ❤️</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">A special message from Omar</p>

        <button class="envelope-btn" onclick="revealMessage()">Tap to Open 💌</button>

        <div class="hidden-message" id="message">
            <div class="arabic-text">
                ازيك يا شاهي يا حبيبتي كل سنه وانت طيبه يا روحي و عقبال مليون سنه و كل سنه واحنا سوا و مع بعض دايما و مبسوطين ربنا يخليكي ليا و تفضلي جنبي دايما ❤️
            </div>
            
            <p>I know it is kinda weird, but I'd like to make a cute memory between us and a "bit" creative, something that we can look back to if we are ever in a bad situation, and always remember that I'll always be by your side.</p>
            <br>
            <p>We won't leave each other again, and I really believe that we are made for each other. Everything I do, whether I'm with you or not, will never be enough to express how much I love you and how much I want to spend the rest of my life with you.</p>
            <br>
            <p>And always remember, whatever happens, even if things get complicated or we face hard days, I will always choose to fix things and stay with you. So don't ever think that I'll leave you one day or choose someone else.</p>
            <br>
            <p>I hope you feel the same way about me, and know that this is not just a message I typed. I wrote all of this from my heart, and I really mean every single word.</p>
            
            <div class="signature">
                Forever yours,<br>
                Omar ❤️
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        function revealMessage() {
            const msg = document.getElementById('message');
            const btn = document.querySelector('.envelope-btn');
            
            msg.style.display = 'block';
            btn.style.display = 'none';
        }

        function createHeart() {
            const container = document.getElementById('hearts-container');
            const heart = document.createElement('div');
            heart.classList.add('heart-particle');
            
            const hearts = ['❤️', '💖', '💕', '💗', '🌸'];
            heart.innerText = hearts[Math.floor(Math.random() * hearts.length)];
            
            heart.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + 'vw';
            heart.style.animationDuration = (Math.random() * 3 + 4) + 's';
            heart.style.fontSize = (Math.random() * 15 + 15) + 'px';
            
            container.appendChild(heart);

            setTimeout(() => {
                heart.remove();
            }, 7000);
        }

        setInterval(createHeart, 350);
    </script>
</body>
</html>
